From d361504d0f75c5a32aadee43a021e2a6c6095797 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:15:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add server-side autohunt (/autohunt)

Players can type /autohunt (or /ah) to have the server hunt nearby monsters:
it jumps toward the nearest monster, attacks through the normal combat code,
picks up silver, Dragonballs and Meteors, and drinks potions when low.
/autohunt <skill name> attacks with a known offensive skill instead.
Stops on death, map change, manual movement or being attacked by a player.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012QZ2EofieBFmMsHF9Yardw
